      "node_id": "kg_doc_1",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Red Ochre Award was established in 1993 by the Australia Council for the Arts. It is awarded annually to an outstanding Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander artist for lifetime achievement.",
